(96, 20, 'what is the one thing gives you joy?', NULL, 'admin', '2023-12-18 14:16:28', '2023-12-18 14:16:44'),
(98, 9, 'What brings you joy?', 'But/and, I also and specifically want to talk about how hard it can feel for those who come from relational trauma backgrounds to even remotely know what brings them joy if they didn’t experience joy in their childhood and/or if they have a hard time connecting to their bodies.\r\n\r\nIf this is you – if the idea of what brings you joy mystifies you and you have no clue what this might mean or how to bring more of it into your life but you’re curious and eager to do so – please keep reading.', 'user', '2024-04-03 11:21:43', '2024-04-03 11:21:43'),
(99, 9, 'What is one thing that you\'d like to be different by this time next year?', 'That\'s one thing I\'m planning to do differently in 2018. Be it my resolutions I make on the first day of the year, or anything, I\'ll be determined at the start, and end up not caring about it in the end.\r\n\r\nNo excuses anymore. I guess that will bring a lot of difference in my life. If I think ‘I need to do it\', I\'m gonna have to do it for sure, be it right or wrong. Now that being said, I shouldn\'t worry about the outcome, if it turns out bad. Of course we do mistakes.', 'user', '2024-04-04 05:53:48', '2024-04-04 05:53:48'),
(100, 9, 'My dog died', 'I was depressed', 'user', '2024-04-04 21:39:31', '2024-04-04 21:39:31'),
(101, 255, 'Empowered', 'Feeling empowered and motiviated about the DX', 'user', '2024-04-05 03:05:03', '2024-04-05 03:05:03'),
