(84, 18, NULL, 'single-image', 'dfsdf', 'section2-right', '&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n            &lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n        This group will discuss your journey in life and living  get at your purpose in life.  It is open to anyone who wants to begin the\r\n        journey of discovery about why they are here on this earth. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The group will focus on:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;Your understanding of your purpose&lt;/li&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;The definition of purpose as defined by known concepts (such as biblical/religious principles) and authors and gurus in the field,\r\n                    including but not limited to Oprah Winfrey, Maya Angelou, John Maxwell, Rick Warren) &lt;/li&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;Your definition of Life and Living&lt;/li&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;Increasing your ability to be who you feel you were meant to be&lt;/li&gt;\r\n                &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Members are expected to complete homework assignments to achieve maximum benefit.\r\n  Members will discuss their experiences in the session. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader – Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group.  Will range anywhere from $150 to $600 for the entire duration of the group. &lt;/li&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                  &lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW.\r\n                        Funds are limited.  For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n                &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n                            &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;Submit the online  &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment.\r\n                                  You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n                            &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n                            &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n                            &lt;/div&gt;\r\n                            &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;h5 class=&quot