r those who are prescribers to IWTIW.\r\n                        Funds are limited.  For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n                &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n                            &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;Submit the online  &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment.\r\n                                  You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n                            &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n                            &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n                            &lt;/div&gt;\r\n                            &lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n                                &lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n\r\n                              &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n                            &lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n              &lt;/div&gt;', 'sdfsdf', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-12 01:02:37');
INSERT INTO `page_contents` (`id`, `page_id`, `parent_id`, `type`, `section_title`, `section_name`, `section_content`, `section_file`, `slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(88, 18, 87, 'galleryt2', 'SAVES YOUR TIME', 'section4', 'No long waits to get in to see a doctor and no time off of work. You can even meet with the doctor in the privacy of your own home with an online doctor visit.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_time-save.png', 'saves-your-time', NULL, '2022-07-14 12:02:02'),
(89, 18, 87, 'galleryt2', 'SAVES YOUR MONEY', 'section4', 'No need in paying for costly office visits, urgent care visits, or emergency rooms.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_money-save.png', 'saves-your-money', NULL, '2022-07-14 12:02:02'),
(91, 18, NULL, 'text', 'dfsdf', 'section5', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30 text-center&quot;&gt;When should you use Telemedicine?&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;main-tu-content-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a common urgent condition that is NOT chronic.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you need a temporary prescription refill for a chronic condition (a refill will be determined by the physician on call).&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you cannot reach your primary care physician.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you need a short-term prescription refill.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have young children and are unable to see a doctor.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When it&amp;rsquo;s after your doctor&amp;#39;s normal business hours.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you&amp;#39;re on vacation or traveling away from home.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a specific health-related question.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you&amp;#39;re not sure you need to go to an urgent care center or ER.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you cannot afford to take time off of work.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;mb-0 mt-3 theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Research shows that 70% of all doctor&amp;rsquo;s office visits are unnecessary, and over a third of all minor medical conditions can be treated without a trip to the doctor at all.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'sdfsdf', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-12 01:52:36'),
(92, 18, NULL, 'text', 'dfsdf', 'section6', '&lt;div class=&quot;inner-promo-home cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-delay: 0.3s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-1.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;75%&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;of most practices&lt;br /&gt;\nare closed after 6 pm&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.5s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-delay: 0.5s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-2.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;4hrs&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Average time in the&lt;br /&gt;\nemergency waiting room&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.7s&quot; data-wow-duration=&quot;1s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-duration: 1s; animation-delay: 0.7s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-3.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;21&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Average number of days&lt;br /&gt;\nto schedule Dr. appt.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.9s&quot; data-wow-duration=&quot;1s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-duration: 1s; animation-delay: 0.9s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-4.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;66%&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;of ER visits&lt;br /&gt;\nare non-emergency&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'sdfsdf', NULL, NULL, '2022-07-14 12:02:02'),
(93, 19, NULL, 'boarding', 'Telemedicine', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader &amp;ndash; Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group. Will range anywhere from $300 to $900 for the entire duration of the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW. Funds are limited. For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-12 01:52:36'),
(94, 19, 93, 'boarding', 'Message a Specialist', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul cla