p  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-12 01:52:36'),
(109, 20, 108, 'boarding', 'Care Coordinator', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class