InUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636912132_Advocacy-Program.jpg', 'care-coordinator', NULL, '2022-04-22 19:16:52'),
(110, 20, NULL, 'text', 'Message A Specialist', 'section2-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents bg-white  healthcare-Advocacy-box  wow fadeInUp   animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Care Coordination Help&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Contact a Care Coordinator to help you navigate through the complicated medical industry, any medical billing concerns, or even getting a negotiated price with a medical facility.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636703494_tele-counseling.png', NULL, NULL, '2022-06-07 00:02:02'),
(111, 20, NULL, 'text', 'Message A Specialist', 'section2-right-top', '&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-left theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Have a question or concern, message a ...&lt;/h2&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636703494_tele-counseling.png', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-14 04:22:36'),
(112, 20, NULL, 'galleryt2', 'Message A Specialist', 'section2-right-bottom', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader &amp;ndash; Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group. Will range anywhere from $300 to $900 for the entire duration of the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW. Funds are limited. For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636703494_tele-counseling.png', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-12 02:21:34'),
(113, 20, 112, 'galleryt2', 'Understanding Your Choices', 'section2-right-bottom', 'Provide guidance for choosing a healthcare plan. Of the options presented to you, we can help you choose\nwhich is the best choice for you and your family.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1652623433_Pharmacist 5.15.22 2.avif', 'understanding-your-choices', NULL, '2022-06-07 00:11:42'),
(114, 20, 112, 'gallery', 'Knowing Your Coverages', 'section2-right-bottom', 'Our team wants you to understand your medical, mental, dental, and vision benefits. We are here to\nanswer any questions that you have.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1652315816_Dietician 5.11.22.jpg', 'knowing-your-coverages', NULL, '2022-06-07 00:11:42'),
(115, 20, 112, 'gallery', 'Understanding Your Coverages', 'section2-right-bottom', 'We want to make sure you know the extra benefits that your coverages provide, i,e, telemedicine, disease\nmanagement, Employee Assistance Program.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1652315816_Dentist 5.11.22.jpg', 'understanding-your-coverages', NULL, '2022-06-07 00:11:42'),
(116, 20, 112, 'gallery', 'Know Your Coverage Responsibilities', 'section2-right-bottom', 'Help you make informed choices based on what your copays and deductibles are for each scenario, so you\nare not surprised when you utilize the services.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1652315816_Pediatrician 5.11.22.jpg', 'know-your-coverage-responsibilities', NULL, '2022-06-07 00:11:42'),
(117, 20, 112, 'gallery', 'Care Coordination', 'section2-right-bottom', 'We help provide an opportunity to schedule appointments, confirm coverages, move medical records, and\nfind the proper care for each person.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1652315816_General Practitioner 5.11.22.jpg', 'care-coordination', NULL, '2022-06-07 00:11:42'),
(118, 20, 112, 'gallery', 'Billing Issues', 'section2-right-bottom', 'We have a team that can help understand, and potentially fix, any billing issues that arise. Researching\nand fixing bills you receive, so that you are not overpaying for the services you and your family received.', 'uploads/pageFiles/1652315816_Opthamologist 5.11.22.jpg', 'billing-issues', NULL, '2022-06-07 00:11:42');
