(121, 21, 120, 'boarding', 'Prescription Policy', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader &amp;ndash; Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group. Will range anywhere from $300 to $900 for the entire duration of the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW. Funds are limited. For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636912623_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 12:27:03'),
(122, 21, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30 text-transform-none&quot;&gt;iWILL &amp;lsquo;til i&amp;rsquo;mWELL Prescription Policy&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Physicians providing consultations for iWill &amp;lsquo;til i&amp;rsquo;mWell members may offer online prescriptions that deliver direct medicinal value. These include, but are not limited to, drug classes such as antibiotics and antihistamines.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Physicians will not write *prescriptions for controlled substances.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Physicians will issue online prescriptions if they are able to gather the appropriate information to accurately diagnose and treat a given condition.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Physicians will issue online prescriptions that are indicated and approved by the physician and as permitted by law in your state.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Physicians will usually limit the prescription supply to no more than thirty days.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Physicians may also refer patients to their primary care physician for the appropriate level of care when indicated.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Patients with chronic illnesses should visit their primary care physicians or other specialists for extended care.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;p-0 m-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;qustion-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h4&gt;iWILL &amp;lsquo;til i&amp;rsquo;mWELL&amp;rsquo;s network physicians do not issue&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Online prescriptions for controlled substances regulated by the DEA&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Prescriptions used for non-therapeutic purposes.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Substances that may be harmful (potential for abuse or addiction)&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;p-0 m-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;*For a current list of&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deadiversion.usdoj.gov/schedules/orangebook/c_cs_alpha.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; DEA controlled substances&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;p-0 mb-0&quot;&gt;Please follow the instructions detailed on the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fda.gov/ForConsumers/ConsumerUpdates/ucm101653.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; FDA website &lt;/a&gt; regarding proper methods of disposing of unused medicines.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 12:27:03'),
(123, 22, NULL, 'boarding', 'Telemedicine', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader &amp;ndash; Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group. Will range anywhere from $300 to $900 for the entire duration of the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW. Funds are limited. For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-12 01:52:36'),
(124, 22, 123, 'boarding', 'Professional Wellness Partners', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader &amp;ndash; Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group. Will range anywhere from $300 to $900 for the entire duration of the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW. Funds are limited. For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636914372_mental-health.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 12:56:12'),
(125, 22, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- &lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Professional Wellness Partners&lt;/h2&gt; --&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Join us at IWillTilImWell if you want to partner&amp;nbsp;with a company that is working to help enable the physical, emotional, mental and spiritual well-being of people in need.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;We are in need of&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;row caring-content-sec&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-4 mb-3 mb-lg-0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;inner-list-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h4&gt;Caring for the Body&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;text-dark&quot;&gt;Medical Providers&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Nurses&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Registered Dietitians&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Nutritionists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Physical Therapists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Massage Therapists&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-4 mb-3 mb-lg-0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;inner-list-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h4&gt;Caring for the Soul&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;text-dark&quot;&gt;Mental Health Providers&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Mental Health Counselors&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Licensed Professional Counselors&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Marriage and Family Therapists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Psychiatrists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Social Workers&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Psychologists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Psychologists with Prescriptive Authority&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Psychology Residents&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Psychology Predoctoral Interns&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Psychology Postdoctoral Fellows&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Psychology Advanced Practicum Students&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Wellness Coaches&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Peer Health Educators&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Interns/Advanced&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-4 mb-3 mb-lg-0&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;inner-list-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h4&gt;Caring for the Spirit&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;text-dark&quot;&gt;Spiritual Providers&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Yoga Instructors&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Spiritual Leaders&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Meditation Instructors&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;hr /&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;content-text-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;inner-sec&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30 theme-color&quot;&gt;Because beautifying the body plays a significant role in healing your mental health, we are also looking for:&lt;/h3&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Wellness Providers&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Beauticians/Barbers&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Makeup Artists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Estheticians&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Nail Stylists&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;mb-0&quot;&gt;If you are interested in partnering with us to help heal the people&amp;#39;s souls, please submit your statement of interest along with your resume or curriculum vitae to&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@iwilltilimwell.com&quot;&gt; info@iwilltilimwell.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;h6 class=&quot;font-weight-blod&quot;&gt;Attention of Dr. Jill Rovaris.&lt;/h6&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-08 11:10:35'),
(126, 23, NULL, 'boarding', 'Telemedicine', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader &amp;ndash; Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group. Will range anywhere from $300 to $900 for the entire duration of the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW. Funds are limited. For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-12 01:52:36'),
(127, 23, 126, 'boarding', 'Legal Informational Services', 'section1', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;While some degree of anxiety can be normal, an inability to process or control anxious thoughts can profoundly affect the way you function on a daily.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will teach you how to calm your anxiety while providing a combination of skills training and peer-to-peer interactions. Participants are encouraged to help each other by sharing their stories and struggles with anxiety.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The goal of this group is to provide group members with:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness and understanding of how anxiety affects the body and everyday life.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increased awareness of our human limitations while learning to bestow grace on ourselves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Coping skills to implement when experiencing anxiety.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Connection with others to help normalize the process and journey towards a healthier version of yourself.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;There may be homework assignments given in the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n