uot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636915120_legal-banner.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 13:08:40'),
(128, 23, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Information&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-01-17 05:37:29'),
(129, 24, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;banner-cont&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Medical&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  text-white  text-capitalize animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;frequently asked questions&lt;/h4&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 13:32:49'),
(130, 24, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636916569_medical-banner.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 13:32:49');
INSERT INTO `page_contents` (`id`, `page_id`, `parent_id`, `type`, `section_title`, `section_name`, `section_content`, `section_file`, `slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(131, 24, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row  my-4 mb-3 pd-l-2 &quot;&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Frequently asked questions?&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul class=&quot;col-sm-6 col-md-12&quot; id=&quot;accordion&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Question one --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseOne&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseOne&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What is Telemedicine?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingOne&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseOne&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;IWTIW is an affordable, convenient way to resolve routine medical conditions. Our unique and secure technology makes it possible to see a doctor face to face on your smartphone, desktop, or telephone without you having to leave your home. With video, providers can look, listen and engage with you to diagnose your health concerns and provide an effective treatment plan.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse11&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse11&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What is an online doctor visit?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading11&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse11&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;IWTIW is an affordable, convenient way to resolve routine medical conditions. Our unique, secure, technology makes it possible to see a doctor, face to face, without you having to leave your home on your smartphone, desktop or telephone. With video, providers can look, listen and engage with you to diagnose your health concerns and provide an effective treatment plan.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question two --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseTwo&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseTwo&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What conditions can be treated via Telemedicine?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseTwo&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Telemedicine is designed to handle non-emergency medical problems. You should NOT use it if you are experiencing a medical emergency. &lt;span class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;CALL 911&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;*** Note: Physician will not treat newborns or children less than two (2) years of age.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;inner-faq-listview&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Allergies&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Bronchitis&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Cold / Flu&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Ear Infection&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Eye Infection&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Fever&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Headache&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Heart Burn&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Nausea&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Rash/ Skin Infection / Small Wound&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Sinus Infection&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Sore Throat&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Stomachache / Diarrhea&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Upper Respiratory Infection&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Urinary Tract Infection&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Yeast Infection&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Many more&amp;hellip;&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse12&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse12&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Why would I see a doctor online?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading12&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse12&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Illness or injury can happen at any time. IWTIW is available to you no matter where you are or what time of day.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Maybe you can&amp;rsquo;t really fit a visit into your already over-booked schedule.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Maybe it&amp;rsquo;s difficult for you to get a doctor&amp;rsquo;s appointment.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Maybe you&amp;rsquo;re not sure if you should go to the ER or not.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Maybe your doctor&amp;rsquo;s office is closed and you don&amp;rsquo;t want to go to an urgent care clinic or hospital.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Maybe you don&amp;rsquo;t have a PCP.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;If you want a second opinion.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse13&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse13&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can I add my spouse and children to my account?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading13&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse13&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;If you bought the family package, you can add your spouse and family to your account. To keep health information private each adult must create an account . Children under 18 may be added to their parent&amp;rsquo;s accounts.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;If you are having a telephonic or phone-only visit, stricter regulations will apply. In certain states, you may have to have a video visit to get a prescription.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse14&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse14&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can my kids see a doctor at IWTIW?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading14&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse14&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Children, under the age of 18 may easily be added to your IWTIW account.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse15&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse15&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What if I don&amp;#39;t have health insurance?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading15&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse15&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;All of IWTIW&amp;#39;s services are available without insurance. However, you will need to cover the cost of your prescriptions or prescription refills.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse16&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse16&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Do I need to schedule an appointment?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading16&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse16&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;IWTIW is designed for on-demand care, so no appointment is necessary. After you register and log in to IWTIW, you can request to consult with a doctor at any time. Based on call volume, we can guarantee&amp;nbsp;a call back anytime from within 5 minutes up to a 2 hour window.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question three --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseThree&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseThree&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What types of doctors are in your network?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingThree&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseThree&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Emergency Medicine Doctors&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Family Medicine Doctors&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;General Practitioners&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Pediatricians&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Internists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question Four --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseFour&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseFour&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can I choose my doctor?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingFour&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseFour&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;Not at this time. To provide quick /efficient service, when a consultation is requested, it will go into a queue. The first available physician who is licensed in your state will accept and process the consultation.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse18&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse18&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can a doctor at IWTIW be my regular provider?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading18&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse18&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;Unfortunately, no. Doctors on IWTIW are there to support your care when you have a non-emergency or chronic health condition or when you are traveling.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse19&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse19&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can a doctor at IWTIW order lab tests?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading19&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse19&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;Unfortunately, no. Doctors at IWTIW are unable to order lab tests. Due to the nature of telehealth, it is difficult to follow up, obtain the results, and interpret these tests. Our providers may suggest following up with your in-person provider and obtaining a test, however they are unable to order a test on your behalf.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse20&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse20&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can IWTIW notify my primary care provider (PCP) of my visit?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading20&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse20&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;No, unfortunately, not at this time.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse21&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse21&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Is my online doctor visit private and secure?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading21&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse21&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;Yes, we feel it is of utmost importance to maintain patient privacy and keep information secure. IWTIW is designed to be a private, secure, HIPAA-compliant tool that allows you to safely and confidentially consult with a doctor online.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse22&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse22&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;I don&amp;rsquo;t have a smartphone or computer, is there another way to talk with a doctor?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading22&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse22&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;With an active account, there is a number that can be provided for you., to conveniently schedule your consultation.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Questiion Five --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseFive&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseFive&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Do you provide telemedicine in every state?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingFive&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseFive&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Yes.&lt;/span&gt; Telemedicine services are provided in every state.\n\n	&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink pt-2&quot;&gt;(Currently, Arkansas law as of 9-1-2017 requires initial consultation be in a video and all subsequent consults can be performed via phone.)&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question Six--&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseSix&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseSix&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Do you provide consults outside the United States?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseSix&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;No,&lt;/span&gt; consults are not available outside the United States.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseSeven&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseSeven&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Do you provide access to a doctor 24/7?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseSeven&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Yes.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;theme-playfair-family&quot;&gt;IWTIW &lt;/span&gt;provides access to a doctor 24/7/365 days a year.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseEight&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseEight&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Do you provide video consultations in every state?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseEight&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Our system is HIPAA compliant and regulated by the state. We provide video in those states that allow video consultations.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;(Arkansas law as of 9-1-2017 requires initial consultation be in a video and all subsequent consults can be performed via phone.)&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Delaware and Idaho law requires a consult be done by video only.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse23&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse23&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can I see a doctor online if I am traveling or in another state?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading23&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse23&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Yes, just make sure to select the state you&amp;rsquo;re in under My Location and you&amp;rsquo;ll only see doctors licensed to treat you in that state. When using the app, you can choose to update your current state based on mobile geolocation, making it faster to find a doctor, whether you are home or on the go. Doctor visits via telehealth are permitted in every state nationwide.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseNine&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseNine&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What is your response time after a consultation has been requested?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseNine&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;We guarantee a call back within two (2) hours. Our average response time is 23 minutes.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse24&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse24&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What should I do if I am experiencing a medical emergency?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading24&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse24&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;If you think you&amp;rsquo;re experiencing a medical emergency, please do not use IWTIW. Instead, seek immediate emergency care by calling 911.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;IWTIW is also not for people suffering from serious or life-threatening conditions, such as:&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Seizures&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Chest pain&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Neurological symptoms, suggesting a stroke&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Difficulty breathing&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Dizziness or loss of consciousness&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Sudden bleeding&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Choking or gagging&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Severe Hypertension or Hemorrhoids&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Head injury&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Possible broken bones&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Cancer&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Patients who want to hurt themselves (suicidality)&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Patients who want to hurt others (homicidality)&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Schizophrenia or hallucinations&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;If you have any of the above symptoms or any other serious medical concerns please call 911 or proceed to the nearest emergency department.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse25&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse25&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can medical forms (like sick slips) be filled out?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading25&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse25&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;Doctors at IWTIW are able to provide simple forms like sick slips or back-to-work/school documents as clinically appropriate. Be sure to request the documentation before ending your conversation. Please note that doctors at IWTIW are not able to provide more substantial documents like FMLA forms, disability forms, or handicap/DMV documents as these documents require an in-person evaluation.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseTen&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseTen&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Do you use a third party for your doctor network?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseTen&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;No.&lt;/span&gt; We have our own, proprietary network of doctors.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseNew&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseNew&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;How do you recruit your doctors and what is the credentialing process?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseNew&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;We post physician job postings in different states. Each applicant (physician) must provide a copy of the current professional license, current DEA registration if applicable, curriculum vitae, and the face sheet of the applicant&amp;#39;s current professional liability insurance policy. NCQA (National Committee Quality Assurance) stipulates that seven criteria must be verified from the primary source because they identify the legal authority to practice as well as the relevant training and experience.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse11&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse11&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Do you provide a Spanish-speaking service?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse11&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;IWTIW provides a full Spanish experience. This allows an individual to utilize the member portal in Spanish, speak with a Care Coordinator in Spanish, and consult with a doctor in Spanish, providing a full experience in your native language.&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse13&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse13&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can your doctors prescribe medication?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse13&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Yes.&lt;/span&gt; The patient will be provided a prescription if the consulting doctor deems it necessary. However, doctors will not prescribe substances controlled by the DEA, non-therapeutic and /or certain drugs that may be harmful due to potential abuse. Drugs such as marijuana, opioids, Ambien, and lifestyle drugs such as Viagra, Cialis, Propecia, or Rogaine will not be prescribed.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;**Doctor will not refill maintenance medication (high blood pressure, high cholesterol, and diabetes) &lt;strong&gt;if the patient has not visited with their primary care physician in over six (6) months&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse14&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse14&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What services are NOT medically treated?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse14&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;We will not treat male UTI&amp;rsquo;s.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;NO treatment for anxiety/depression.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse26&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse26&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;If my condition cannot be treated through IWTIW, can I still discuss it with a doctor?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading26&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse26&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Yes, but this is at the doctor&amp;#39;s discretion.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse15&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse15&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can a doctor refill a prescription?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse15&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Yes.&lt;/span&gt; A doctor can refill a prescription for reasons such as:&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;The patients Primary Care Physician is on vacation&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;If traveling and your luggage was lost&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Temporary refills, 14 days max&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-08 11:08:42'),
(132, 25, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;banner-cont&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Counseling&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  text-white  text-capitalize animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;frequently asked questions&lt;/h4&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 13:40:05'),
(133, 25, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636917005_counseling-banner-new.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 13:40:05'),
(134, 25, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row  my-4 mb-3 pd-l-2 &quot;&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Frequently asked questions&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;If you or someone you know may be struggling with suicidal thoughts, you can call the U.S. National Suicide Prevention Lifeline at 800-273-TALK (8255) any time day or night, or chat online.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Crisis Text Line also provides free, 24/7, confidential support via text message to people in crisis when they dial 741741.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul class=&quot;col-sm-6 col-md-12&quot; id=&quot;accordion&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Question one --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseOne&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseOne&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What is counseling?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingOne&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseOne&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Counseling is a confidential, collaborative relationship between you and a professional counselor. The counselor will work to help you identify your personal goals, improve your communication and coping skills, find potential solutions, strengthen your levels of self-esteem, promote behavior change, and achieve an optimal level of mental health.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse31&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse31&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What is telecounseling?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading31&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse31&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Telecounseling is the same as counseling but just via the phone or a computer. You can see a mental health provider to address common behavioral health challenges from the privacy and comfort of your own home.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse32&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse32&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;Do I need to schedule an appointment to meet with a counselor?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading32&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse32&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Mental health counselors are available to you 24/7/365 days a year. You have unlimited access for your in the moment counseling needs and do not need to schedule an appointment. Just reach out and someone will be there for you.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;When you have a particular issue you would like to work on with a mental health counselor, you can make a request and a counselor will connect with you. You can then work with that counselor to schedule ongoing appointments up to 5 sessions per issue, per year.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse33&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse33&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;How long is a typical online counseling session?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading33&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse33&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;A call to a mental health counselor when you&amp;rsquo;re having an &amp;ldquo;in the moment&amp;rdquo; need or a crisis can last as long as deemed appropriate to gain the desired outcome.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;An appointment with a mental health counselor to discuss targeted issues can last up to 45 minutes per session.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question two --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseTwo&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseTwo&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can I meet with my personal counselor when I leave the state where I have been working with my counselor?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseTwo&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Because counselors are only licensed to work in certain states, when you are traveling outside of your home state, you will not be able to work with your assigned counselor while outside your state. You will have to work with the clinical care counselors until you return to your home state&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question three --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseThree&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseThree&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What happens when the 5 sessions are up for this issue and I still need more counseling?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingThree&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseThree&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;When your 5 sessions are up for the issue you are working on and you still need more counseling, you will need to continue your work on this issue with a counselor in private practice. Please consult with IWTIW at &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailto:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt; to request to work with a counselor in private practice.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse34&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed &quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse34&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;For every new issue, can I work with the same counselor?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading34&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse34&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;If you experience a new issue and have established a good working relationship with your existing counselor and both you and the counselor wish to continue to work together, you can continue with this same counselor.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse35&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse35&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;When is short-term telecounseling or TCT not the appropriate or the best choice of service?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading35&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse35&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;When the following exist: &lt;i&gt;(This is not an exhaustive list.) &lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Heightened risk of harm to oneself or others; lack of access to, or difficulty with, communications technology.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Significant communications services disruptions.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;A need for more intensive services such as substance abuse, severe eating disorders, psychosis, or recent psychiatric hospitalization.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;In these cases, you will need to establish a new, greater, or more intense access to care for other appropriate services.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse36&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse36&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Is online counseling private and secure?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading36&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse36&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Yes. It is of utmost importance to maintain patient privacy and keep information secure. IWTIW is designed to be a private, secure, HIPAA-compliant tool that allows you to safely and confidentially consult with a mental health provider.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse37&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse37&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Are online counseling sessions recorded?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading37&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse37&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;No, to ensure privacy and security of data, IWTIW counseling sessions are not recorded. Minimal notes are kept so as to inform the work of the therapist.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse38&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse38&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Who are the counselors/therapists?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading38&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse38&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Counselors are master&amp;rsquo;s level therapists practicing in the moment care within all 50 states. For work with a particular issue, all therapists are licensed to practice in their state and trained in prevention and treatment techniques via telehealth.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse39&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse39&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What should I do if I am having a mental health emergency or crisis?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading39&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse39&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;IWTIW cannot provide emergency mental health. If you believe you are in crisis, please call/contact any of the following numbers for care:&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;911 or go to the nearest emergency room&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;The National Suicide Prevention Hotline: 800-273-8255 (24 hours)&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;The crisis text line: Text HOME to 741741 (24 hours) or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisistextline.org/&quot;&gt; https://www.crisistextline.org/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse40&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse40&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Does counseling work for everyone?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading40&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse40&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Yes, but you have to be willing to do the work and to commit to change. Counseling can be very hard and may create disturbances in your existing relationships as you work to grow and to become your best self. Others may not understand, appreciate or accept your growth. It is up to you to determine who you want to be and if this work is for you.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse41&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse41&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Does counseling require a commitment?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading41&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse41&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Counseling requires a commitment. It involves learning new skills, trying new behaviors in the community, and bringing those experiences back to the counseling session to discuss with your counselor.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse42&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse42&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Are there risks in short-term counseling?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading42&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse42&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Yes. There are risks in all forms of counseling.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Short-term TCT services are conducted and documented in a confidential manner according to applicable laws in similar ways as in-person services. However, there is risk in TCT (including, but not limited to):&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Sessions, evaluations, or treatments could be disrupted, delayed, or communication distorted due to technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;TCT involves alternative forms of communication that may reduce visual and auditory cues and increase the likelihood of misunderstanding one another.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;A need for more intensive services such as substance abuse, severe eating disorders, psychosis, or recent psychiatric hospitalization.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Difficulties in accessing all necessary medical information can result in errors in adverse drug interactions, allergic reactions, and other errors in clinical judgment.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Your counselor may determine TCT is not an appropriate treatment option or stop TCT treatment at any time if your condition changes or TCT presents barriers to treatment.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;In rare cases, security protocols could fail, and your confidential information could be accessed by unauthorized persons.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question Four --&gt;&lt;!-- &lt;li&gt;\n                &lt;div class=&quot;collapsed&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseFour&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; aria-controls=&quot;collapseFour&quot;&gt;\n                  When i have a new issue, can i work with the same counselor?\n                  &lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-chevron-down fa-1x text-info pull-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n                &lt;/div&gt;\n                &lt;div id=&quot;collapseFour&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;headingFour&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot;&gt;\n                  &lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n                    If you experience a new issue and have established a good working relationship with your existing counselor\n                    and both you and the counselor wish to continue to work together, you can continue with this same counselor.\n\n                  &lt;/div&gt;\n                &lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;/li&gt; --&gt;&lt;!-- Questiion Five --&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-01-31 03:27:11'),
(135, 26, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;banner-cont&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Prescription&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  text-white  text-capitalize animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;frequently asked questions&lt;/h4&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:34:13'),
(136, 26, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636949053_Prescription.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:34:13');
INSERT INTO `page_contents` (`id`, `page_id`, `parent_id`, `type`, `section_title`, `section_name`, `section_content`, `section_file`, `slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(137, 26, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row  my-4 mb-3 pd-l-2 &quot;&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Frequently asked questions&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul class=&quot;col-sm-6 col-md-12&quot; id=&quot;accordion&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Question one --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse1&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse1&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;Can a doctor on IWTIW prescribe medication?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading1&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse1&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Yes, you can get a prescription online. There is support for this nationwide, however, there are several exceptions.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse2&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse2&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What are the prescription exceptions?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading2&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse2&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Consultation with a medical provider is available to you 24/7/365 days a year and during your visit, your provider may recommend an online prescription.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Please make sure to tell your medical provider about any existing prescriptions or over the counter medications you are taking. Some medications do not react well with other medications, so it&amp;rsquo;s important to be honest and open with your provider to avoid complications.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Prescriptions are now available to patients nationwide. With telehealth services being in all 50 states, you can have a visit and receive a potential prescription anywhere across the country. However, there are many medications that cannot be prescribed online, including controlled substances.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse3&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse3&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What are controlled substance medications?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading3&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse3&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Certain medications that are potentially addictive are considered &amp;ldquo;controlled&amp;rdquo;, and can only be prescribed by a provider who has met you in person first, as per the federal regulation, The Ryan Haight Act of 2008.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;h5 class=&quot;fs-18&quot;&gt;Examples of controlled medications are:&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Benzodiazepines - used for anxiety, panic, sleep disorders, tremors, and seizures - include medications such as Xanax, Ativan, Restoril, Valium, Klonopin, and Librium&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Hypnotics - used for insomnia - include medications such as Ambien, Ambien CR, Lunesta, and Sonata&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Stimulants - used for ADD/ADHD, fatigue, depression, cognitive issues, and narcolepsy - include medications such as Dextroamphetamine, Adderall, Vyvanse, Dexedrine, Methylphenidate, Ritalin, Concerta, Focalin, Provigil, and Nuvigil&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Opioids, used for pain, and will not generally be recommended by psychiatrists&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse4&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse4&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;Can a doctor on IWTIW order a prescription refill?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading4&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse4&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Doctors on IWTIW will discuss your health history and assess whether a refill is safe at this time or whether it would be necessary to see your primary care physician in person.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;The decision to provide a refill is at the sole discretion of the doctor.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Be sure to share any information you have about your health history and condition that may help facilitate your refill, such as recent lab tests, blood pressure readings, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:34:13'),
(138, 27, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;banner-cont&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Legal Informational Services&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  text-white  text-capitalize animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;frequently asked questions&lt;/h4&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:36:42'),
(139, 27, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636949202_legal-informational.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:36:42'),
(140, 27, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row  my-4 mb-3 pd-l-2 &quot;&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Frequently asked questions&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul class=&quot;col-sm-6 col-md-12&quot; id=&quot;accordion&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Question one --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse1&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse1&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;How should I use this service?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading1&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;This service is for informational purposes only to help guide you in understanding your case.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse2&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag collapsed&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse2&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;Is this information given considered legal advice?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading2&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse2&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;No, this information given is to be taken for informational purposes only.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse3&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag collapsed&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse3&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What is the advantage of using a legal informational service instead of doing the work myself?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading3&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse3&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;You don&amp;rsquo;t do the research.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Research is quality, faster, and more reliable.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;You will have the confidence of knowing that the information is accurate and up to date.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Expert insights, the text of statutes, regulators, and cases.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;You will get case summaries and notes to aid in your understanding of your case.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;You will get the depth and breadth of the legal content you need to help you to understand your case.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse4&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag collapsed&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse4&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;Will my content be authoritative and legitimate?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading4&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse4&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Yes, the given content will be authoritative and legitimate and will leave you with crucial information to fertilize your understanding.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Our experts can help ensure your legal research is lined up with industry standards and offer strategies and advice on using that information.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse5&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;span-lag collapsed&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse5&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;Why use this service?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading5&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse5&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;We have the skills and the tools to find what you need. We work to paint a complete picture and deliver the most reliable information.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:36:42'),
(141, 28, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;banner-cont&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counseling&lt;/h1&gt;\n\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  text-white  text-capitalize animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;frequently asked questions&lt;/h4&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:46:40'),
(142, 28, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636949800_counseling-banner.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:46:40'),
(143, 28, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row  my-4 mb-3 pd-l-2 &quot;&gt;\n&lt;h3&gt;Frequently asked questions&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;If you or someone you know may be struggling with suicidal thoughts, you can call the U.S. National Suicide Prevention Lifeline at 800-273-TALK (8255) any time day or night, or chat online.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Crisis Text Line also provides free, 24/7, confidential support via text message to people in crisis when they dial 741741.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul class=&quot;col-sm-6 col-md-12&quot; id=&quot;accordion&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- Question one --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseOne&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseOne&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What is group counseling?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingOne&quot; class=&quot;collapse show&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseOne&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Group counseling provides a context of support for people who may feel alone in their struggles or would like to hear or share in the perspectives of others. Group counseling is guided by a professional counselor.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;h5 class=&quot;fs-18 mb-3&quot;&gt;The &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK64214/&quot;&gt;five most common types&lt;/a&gt; are as follows:&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n	&lt;div class=&quot;group-guidelines-content2 group-guidelines-new&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;ul&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt; Support Groups:&lt;/strong&gt; are designed to help people to cope with significant life changes, such as the loss of a loved one. Support groups are designed to help members to reflect on their personal beliefs and growth while giving and receiving unconditional acceptance.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt; Interpersonal Process Groups:&lt;/strong&gt; are designed to promote positive change by looking at early life experiences and how they shaped your psyche. It also is free to examine subconscious beliefs and feelings as the foundation of their personality and behaviors. These groups usually focus on a specific topic or condition, such as substance use disorder, anxiety, depression, sexual assault, or sexual abuse.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt; Psychoeducational Groups:&lt;/strong&gt; focus on educating members about their conditions and providing them with new coping strategies.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt; Skills Development Groups:&lt;/strong&gt; introduce new skills to members while sharpening or replacing old skills with the overall goal being to help members to strengthen their behavioral and cognitive resources so as to edify their ability to make positive choices while avoiding harmful situations.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt; Cognitive Behavioral Groups:&lt;/strong&gt; work to restructure a person&amp;rsquo;s cognitive belief system and thought processes around identifying situations and environments that trigger destructive or unwanted behaviors that can lead to negative or harmful outcomes. This will allow group members to better be able to develop management strategies that support reduced use.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse31&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse31&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What groups do IWTIW offer?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading31&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse31&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;IWTIW will offer any and all groups depending on the need of the community and the topic being addressed.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse32&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse32&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;Should group members also be receiving individual counseling?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading32&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse32&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Group counseling at times is best complemented with individual therapy. Of course, that depends upon the individual and the group topic. Although group counseling can serve as the primary and only source of treatment, many people find that working simultaneously in both group and individual counseling stimulates the greatest beneficial growth.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse33&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse33&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot; id=&quot;choose&quot;&gt;What kinds of people participate in groups?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading33&quot; class=&quot;collapse &quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse33&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;Group counseling can benefit people from all walks of life. Each group has a particular area of focus, so members can expect to find others going through similar struggles.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question two --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseTwo&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseTwo&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What are some of the benefits/advantages of group therapy?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingTwo&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseTwo&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;It is a more affordable alternative to long term one-on-one therapy sessions&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;div class=&quot;group-guidelines-content2 group-guidelines-new&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;ul&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt; Groups instill hope.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;This happens when group members watch other group members recover from similar problems. This gives hope that you will also have positive treatment outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Groups are a place to receive support from and give support to others who are experiencing similar difficulties&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt; Groups offer universality.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Groups contribute to a two-way transfer of knowledge either by group participation and/or through the observation of others.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Group therapy brings people together who have similar experiences. When you see other people experiencing, working through, and recovering from similar issues, it helps you to realize that they are not alone.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Hearing the stories of others reminds us that our struggles are not as different as we think.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Learning from and with other people can also help us to gain greater insight and a greater understanding of our own thinking, emotional and behavioral patterns.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Members are exposed to new behaviors, thoughts, and beliefs that may shift their perspectives to a healthier perspective&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Groups present a place where people feel that they are not alone&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt; Sharing information.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Groups contribute to a two-way transfer of knowledge either by group participation and/or through the observation of others.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Group members and the group leaders can help each other through the sharing of pertinent information and offering advice.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt; Allows for altruism.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Group members can help can support, encourage and reassure one another to improve while building on each&amp;rsquo;s levels of self-confidence and self-esteem.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Groups offer positive support systems&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt; Development of social skills.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Group members can give and receive constructive feedback that can help everyone to better engage in social interactions outside the group.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;6.&lt;/span&gt; Imitative behavior or modeling.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Groups contribute to a two-way transfer of knowledge either by group participation and/or through the observation of others.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Group members may desire to imitate the healthier behaviors they observe in group leaders or other group members.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;7.&lt;/span&gt; Interpersonal learning.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Through feedback and self-observation, group members can gain awareness of their own strengths and limitations of their own interpersonal behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;8.&lt;/span&gt; Group cohesiveness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Being in a group with a common goal, members can gain a sense of belonging.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;\n		&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mr-1&quot;&gt;9.&lt;/span&gt; Catharsis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n		&lt;ul class=&quot;theme-list-view&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Groups contribute to a two-way transfer of knowledge either by group participation and/or through the observation of others.&lt;/li&gt;\n			&lt;li&gt;Sharing feelings, experiences, and pain with a group can help you to release anger and repressed emotions.&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;/ul&gt;\n		&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;!-- Question three --&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapseThree&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapseThree&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What if I&amp;rsquo;m uncomfortable or feel exposed to discussing my problems in front of others?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;headingThree&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapseThree&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;This is a common experience of many. It is not unusual to feel uneasy or embarrassed when first joining a group, but you will begin to develop interest and trust.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Just the ability to share in a private, confidential setting with others who are experiencing some of your same challenges and hearing how they managed and overcame those challenges will offer you a great deal of relief.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse34&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse34&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;What kind of commitment must I make to group and to heal?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading34&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse34&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;We ask all group members to commit to their healing and to commit to attending all group sessions within the cycle before registering. We also ask members to commit to completing the required readings and exercises. This is so that every group member can both gain the most from the group and their work while fully participating in the group.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse35&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse35&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;When is short-term telecounseling or TCT not the appropriate or the best choice of service? What is the cost of groups?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading35&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse35&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;The cost varies depending on the type of group. Group members are required to pay in advance and missed sessions are not reimbursed.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Regular attendance impacts the dynamics of the group, so we ask that every member make a serious commitment to attend all group sessions within the cycle of that specific group. Please read and follow all group guidelines and commitments.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Please keep in mind that these are common fees for counseling groups and are designed to be more affordable than individual therapy. Individual therapy can range as high as $350 for one 50-minute session.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;For some groups, scholarships may be available. Please see the specific group for more information.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;\n	&lt;div aria-controls=&quot;collapse36&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;collapsed span-lag&quot; data-target=&quot;#collapse36&quot; data-toggle=&quot;collapse&quot;&gt;Can I cancel my registration and leave a group after I have registered or after the group has begun?&lt;/div&gt;\n\n	&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;heading36&quot; class=&quot;collapse&quot; data-parent=&quot;#accordion&quot; id=&quot;collapse36&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;p&gt;A refund for the group sessions you are unable to attend will only be reimbursed under exceptional circumstances, such as an unexpected illness or a death in the family.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;There is a $100 withdrawal fee once the group begins, regardless of the number of sessions attended or left to attend.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;All members are asked to register only if they are certain they will be able to participate in the full cycle of the group. This work is important to us and we want it to be important to you. We have put everything aside to be fully invested in your healing and growth. We want you to have that same level of investment and commitment.&lt;/p&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n	&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2024-03-19 14:28:03'),
(144, 7, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Pet Tele-Health&lt;/h1&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:54:47'),
(145, 7, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636950287_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:54:47'),
(146, 7, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h1&gt;Coming Soon...&lt;/h1&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:54:47'),
(147, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Employers&lt;/h1&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-01-21 02:35:06'),
(148, 8, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636952628_medical-banner.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 23:33:48'),
(149, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section2', '&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30 text-center&quot;&gt;Enterprise EAP - Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/h2&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 23:33:48'),
(150, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section3', '&lt;p class=&quot;mb-5&quot;&gt;Research shows that 70% of all doctor&amp;rsquo;s office visits are unnecessary.&amp;nbsp; The IWillTilImWell Employee Assistance Program (EAP) has been established to offer Telemedicine, and confidential Telecounseling, to all full time and part time employees, with or without, your company benefits. You decide who is eligible. Services cover a wide range of personal challenges including marital, family, interpersonal, emotional, grief counseling, and drug abuse issues .&lt;/p&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-07-14 09:13:12'),
(151, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section4', '&lt;div class=&quot;row partners-with&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-12&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;inner-child-st-sec wow fadeInLeft   animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInLeft;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;iWILL &amp;lsquo;til i&amp;rsquo;MWELL partners with associations that prioritize employee and member wellness.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;We enable a valuable benefit that attracts and retains members and employees. Offering convenient, high quality and easy to use care directly contributes to employee and member satisfaction while encouraging mental and physical wellness.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Groups and Associations , Schools and Universities, Faith Based Groups, Corporate Employees, State and Local Governments.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Additional benefits, such as access to Veterinarians, Care Navigators, and the ability to message Health Care Specialists, makes this one of the more comprehensive EAP plans available&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2024-03-19 14:26:04'),
(152, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section5', '&lt;card class=&quot;mb-3 d-block wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.1s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-delay: 0.1s; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p class=&quot;mb-4&quot;&gt;The Value of our Employee Assistance Programs:&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;card-body bg-eee d-block mb-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;IMPROVING ACCESS&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Round-the-clock access to our National network of Licensed board-certified physicians and Master level therapists.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/card&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;REDUCTION IN COSTS&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;iWILL til i&amp;rsquo;mWELL can treat over 85% of common conditions typically seen in ER rooms, eliminating unnecessary costs.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;REDUCED ABSENTEEISM&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;No more missing work or school to go to the doctor. Employees and family members can easily consult with a doctor anytime, day or night.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;PREVENTIVE CARE&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Employees and members become more aware of current health conditions, empowering them to be more productive with their own health management.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2024-03-19 14:26:04'),
(153, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section6', '&lt;div class=&quot;Flexible-content-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;mb-4&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h5&gt;Flexible Simple Integrations&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Using our Client Dashboards, you can easily manage member or employee eligibility, and make needed changes: such as additions, terminations, and much more.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;mb-4&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h5&gt;Administrative Reporting&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Group Administrators can access real-time reporting modules to view utilization data needed to drive and understand the real time ROI of iWILL &amp;lsquo;til i&amp;rsquo;mWELL.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;mb-4&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h5&gt;Claims Data Submission&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Every completed consultation is attributed to an ICD claims code. This data can be shared with clients, members, or employees, for proper claims analysis.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-08 12:00:13'),
(154, 8, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section7-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h1&gt;Coming Soon...&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636952628_rgt-feature-img2.png', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 23:33:48'),
(155, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section7-right', '&lt;div class=&quot;content-inner-box&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30 lh-1-4&quot;&gt;Keep your workforce healthy and productive with our On-Demand Services&lt;/h2&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;p class=&quot;fs-20 wow fadeInUp   animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;iWILL &amp;lsquo;til i&amp;rsquo;MWELL is your trusted partner to provide your employees with access to medical care around the clock, saving you money and keeping your workforce healthy. Employees can connect with a physician via telephone or video for medical consultations whenever and wherever they need care.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;benifit-text-box mb-4&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;theme-color&quot;&gt;Benefits of iWILL &amp;lsquo;til i&amp;rsquo;MWELL to Employees:&lt;/h5&gt;\n\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Improves access to healthcare for employees in remote locations.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Reduces employer costs related to employee doctor&amp;#39;s office and ER visits.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Instant access to doctors cuts down on missed work time related to minor health issues.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Helps prevent minor employee health issues from becoming costly conditions.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Safeguards employers against the &amp;quot;Cadillac Tax&amp;quot; related to high health plan premiums&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-08 12:03:39'),
(156, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section8', '&lt;div class=&quot;card-body&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-weight-400 text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The American Medical Association notes that 70% of doctor&amp;#39;s visits can be handled by telephone.&lt;/strong&gt; iwilltilimwell.com gives yours employees easy, streamlined access to board certified doctors via phone, email or video call 24/7.&lt;/h4&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 23:33:48'),
(157, 8, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section9-left', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h1&gt;Coming Soon...&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636952628_telemedicain-img (1).jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 23:33:48'),
(158, 8, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section9-right', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h1&gt;Coming Soon...&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636952628_erpt-feature-img3.png', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 23:33:48'),
(159, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section10', '&lt;pre class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   theme-color text-center animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\nReduce absenteeism, improve productivity, and improve employee retention with IWillTilImWell.&lt;/pre&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-05-05 13:18:01'),
(160, 8, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section11', '&lt;div class=&quot;inner-promo-home cust-container&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-delay: 0.3s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-1.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;75%&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;of most practices&lt;br /&gt;\nare closed after 6 pm&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.5s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-delay: 0.5s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-2.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;4hrs&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Average time in the&lt;br /&gt;\nemergency waiting room&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.7s&quot; data-wow-duration=&quot;1s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-duration: 1s; animation-delay: 0.7s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-3.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;21&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Average number of days&lt;br /&gt;\nto schedule Dr. appt.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box wow bounceIn&quot; data-wow-delay=&quot;0.9s&quot; data-wow-duration=&quot;1s&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-duration: 1s; animation-delay: 0.9s; animation-name: bounceIn;&quot;&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.iwilltilimwell.com/images/promo-icon-4.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;promo-box-right&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2&gt;66%&lt;/h2&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;of ER visits&lt;br /&gt;\nare non-emergency&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-07-14 12:32:12'),
(161, 10, NULL, 'text', 'df', 'section0-left', '&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Teletherapy&lt;/h1&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636627604_light-img.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-28 22:32:02');
INSERT INTO `page_contents` (`id`, `page_id`, `parent_id`, `type`, `section_title`, `section_name`, `section_content`, `section_file`, `slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(162, 10, NULL, 'single-image', 'df', 'section0-right', '&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;This group will discuss your journey in life and living get at your purpose in life. It is open to anyone who wants to begin the journey of discovery about why they are here on this earth.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp   mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;The group will focus on:&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Your understanding of your purpose&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The definition of purpose as defined by known concepts (such as biblical/religious principles) and authors and gurus in the field, including but not limited to Oprah Winfrey, Maya Angelou, John Maxwell, Rick Warren)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Your definition of Life and Living&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Increasing your ability to be who you feel you were meant to be&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Members are expected to complete homework assignments to achieve maximum benefit. Members will discuss their experiences in the session.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Dates and Time&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD (to be determined)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Duration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;# of Weeks TBD by group type and group leader &amp;ndash; Will Range from 3 to 12 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Fees&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Based on the duration of the group. Will range anywhere from $150 to $600 for the entire duration of the group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Materials fee when applicable, $0 to $30.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Scholarships&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Income-based scholarships may be available for those who are prescribers to IWTIW. Funds are limited. For more details, contact &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;mailt:iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&quot;&gt;iwilltilimwell@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Registration&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Submit the online &lt;a class=&quot;theme-color&quot; href=&quot;#0&quot;&gt;registration form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;After you receive a confirmation for attending the group, secure your spot with your payment. You will be officially registered for the group after your payment is received.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Counselor&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;TBD&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;anxiety-content-box&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h5 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  mb-0 animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Group Requirements&lt;/h5&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Continuous weekly attendance is required.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;A counselor will screen members for their appropriateness for this group.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636958944_tele-counseling.png', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-15 01:19:04'),
(163, 29, NULL, 'text', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-left', '&lt;h1 class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;Podcasts Blogs&lt;/h1&gt;\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636701756_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-16 03:52:06'),
(164, 29, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636950287_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:54:47'),
