(167, 30, NULL, 'single-image', 'Telemedicine', 'section1-image', '&lt;div class=&quot;cust-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;consent-forms-contents theme-white-bg theme-pxy-50 theme-border-radius&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wow fadeInUp  animated&quot; style=&quot;visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInUp;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;theme-heading-text fs-30&quot;&gt;Legal Advice&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;When you have a question or may desire a better understanding of the legal rights and remedies relevant to a given situation, an attorney will provide an on-demand general description of the relevant legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Our aim is to provide you additional support by offering basic information and legal descriptions of rights relevant to your situation, suggestion, or question, without directly offering you specific advice.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;The legal information provided in response to your inquiry is to be taken for informational purposes only and should not be construed as legal advice on any subject matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;An attorney will respond directly to your inquiries. This information DOES NOT create an attorney-client relationship between you and IWTIW nor with the subject attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users are encouraged to contact their own attorney to obtain specific legal advice with respect to any particular legal matter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Users should not act or refrain from acting based on information provided here without first seeking legal advice from their attorney.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li&gt;Only your personal attorney can provide assurances that the information provided herein &amp;ndash; and your interpretation of that information &amp;ndash; is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;theme-color-darkpink&quot;&gt;Every subscriber is allowed to ask an attorney two questions or inquiries a year.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n', 'uploads/pageFiles/1636950287_Advocacy-Program.jpg', NULL, NULL, '2021-11-14 22:54:47'),
